Name: rust-fnv
Short Name: rust-fnv
URL: https://github.com/servo/rust-fnv
Version: 1.0.7
Revision: 4e55052a343a4372c191141f29a17ab829cf1dbc
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py rust-fnv, history replayed linearly)
License: Apache-2.0 OR MIT
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Fowler–Noll–Vo hash function

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/rust-fnv/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/rust-fnv/ unchanged.

Crates:
  fnv 1.0.7 third_party/rust-fnv/fnv
